  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu Yi Hai’s blessed land is an ocean whose lifeforms are mainly sea turtles and tortoises, corals, and seagulls. Among them is a field of ancient desolate plant silent corals, beside three ancient desolate beast horned divine tortoises and six desolate beast white letter blue feather seagulls.",
      "chapters": [
        1217
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-in-wu-yi-hais-sea",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yi_hai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the sea area managed by Wu Yi Hai, a huge field of ancient desolate plant silent corals is kept with the horned divine tortoises and white letter blue feather seagulls under the sea turtle land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        1291
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "managed-coral-field",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yi Hai’s immortal aperture is a sea with three lifeform lines: sea turtles and tortoises headed by the ancient desolate beast horned divine tortoise, corals headed by the ancient desolate plant silent coral, and seagulls headed by the desolate beast white letter blue feather seagull. As a transformation path Gu Immortal he raises the species he transforms into, including a coral form.",
      "chapters": [
        1298
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coral-lifeform-line",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan annexes Wu Yi Hai’s blessed land into Mini Eastern Sea, the sea turtle still manages that sea area with its field of ancient desolate plant silent corals beside the horned divine tortoises and white letter blue feather seagulls.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
